---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
---
<Figure id="d-secret-lookup">
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 300" role="img" aria-label="Where the value of a secret the node attaches comes from. Only a name the release the run executes binds to the request's host is attached at all. The instance's own value comes first; else its deployment's, only when the run executes code of a package that deployment covers; else the operator's. The outbound gate then attaches it itself, in the one header or body field the release binds it to, refuses a request that sets that place itself, and replaces any copy of it in the response with [redacted] before the app sees it." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <defs><marker id="sl-arrow" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="6.5" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L6.5,3 L0,6 Z" fill="#8b949e"/></marker></defs>
  <rect x="0" y="0" width="760" height="300" rx="10" fill="#0f0f16"/>
  <text x="380" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="700">attaching a bound secret NAME to one run's request</text>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:0">
    <rect x="16" y="44" width="160" height="78" rx="6" fill="#161b22" stroke="#444c56"/>
    <text x="96" y="64" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">a run sends to HOST</text>
    <text x="96" y="82" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">an instance or a</text>
    <text x="96" y="95" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">unit member</text>
    <text x="96" y="112" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">its release binds NAME there</text>
    <line x1="176" y1="83" x2="198" y2="83" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.2" marker-end="url(#sl-arrow)"/>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:1">
    <rect x="200" y="44" width="150" height="78" rx="6" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="275" y="62" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700">1 · the instance's</text>
    <text x="275" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">PUT /apps/&#123;app&#125;/</text>
    <text x="275" y="93" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">secrets/&#123;name&#125;</text>
    <text x="275" y="111" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">in the app's own log</text>
    <line x1="350" y1="83" x2="372" y2="83" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.2" marker-end="url(#sl-arrow)"/>
    <text x="361" y="76" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5">else</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:2">
    <rect x="374" y="44" width="200" height="78" rx="6" fill="#13160f" stroke="#a5ff11"/>
    <text x="474" y="62" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a5ff11" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700">2 · its deployment's</text>
    <text x="474" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">PUT /deployments/&#123;id&#125;/…</text>
    <text x="474" y="96" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">only if the run's package is</text>
    <text x="474" y="109" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">one the deployment covers</text>
    <line x1="574" y1="83" x2="596" y2="83" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.2" marker-end="url(#sl-arrow)"/>
    <text x="585" y="76" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5">else</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:3">
    <rect x="598" y="44" width="146" height="78" rx="6" fill="#161b22" stroke="#444c56"/>
    <text x="671" y="62" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700">3 · the operator's</text>
    <text x="671" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">[outbound] env_secrets</text>
    <text x="671" y="93" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">or secrets service</text>
    <text x="671" y="111" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">else: nothing</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:4">
    <path d="M474,122 L474,150 L380,150 L380,166" fill="none" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.2" marker-end="url(#sl-arrow)"/>
    <path d="M275,122 L275,150 L380,150" fill="none" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.2"/>
    <path d="M671,122 L671,150 L474,150" fill="none" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.2"/>
    <rect x="160" y="168" width="440" height="58" rx="6" fill="#231708" stroke="#e3b341"/>
    <text x="380" y="188" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e3b341" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">the outbound gate, on the node that runs it</text>
    <text x="380" y="205" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">attached by the node in NAME's one header or body field</text>
    <text x="380" y="219" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">the app setting that place, or &#123;&#123;secret:…&#125;&#125;: refused</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:5">
    <line x1="380" y1="226" x2="380" y2="246" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.2" marker-end="url(#sl-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="160" y="248" width="440" height="36" rx="6" fill="#10210f" stroke="#3fb950"/>
    <text x="380" y="270" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3fb950" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">the response, each copy of the value → [redacted]</text>
  </g>
</svg>
</Figure>
